{"id":"n62883-1-7","stage":1,"title":"흰색 · 白色","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62883-1-7-1","ko":"흰색 옷을 입고 나가도 될까?","zh":"我可以穿白色衣服出门吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"흰색","meaning":"白色","explanation":"흰색：白色。","readings":[{"term":"흰색","audio":"/audio/a1e63f0c6f7b24bd41a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62883","senseId":"1","lemma":"흰색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흰색","audio":"/audio/a1e63f0c6f7b24bd41a4.mp3"}},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷을","audio":"/audio/76fa7acf1b0008045d0c.mp3"}},{"text":"입고","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입고","audio":"/audio/abf4f911317e9d7bed28.mp3"}},{"text":"나가도","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가도","audio":"/audio/34dce4e34fedcac7376c.mp3"}},{"text":"될까?","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"될까","audio":"/audio/f258edd152f7f745b8b0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a1e63f0c6f7b24bd","term":"흰색","zh":"白色","audio":"/audio/a1e63f0c6f7b24bd41a4.mp3","entryId":"62883","definition":"和雪或牛奶一样的浅色。","pronunciation":["힌색"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"因有目的而去某处。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8d3abc33a80772fc033f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62883-1-7-2","ko":"비도 오는데 더러워지지 않을까?","zh":"都在下雨了，不会弄脏吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비도","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비도","audio":"/audio/31c0203d3813abd00ee1.mp3"}},{"text":"오는데","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오는데","audio":"/audio/51958c7a1c8724a56ff3.mp3"}},{"text":"더러워지지","meaning":"脏，污浊；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"더럽다：脏，污浊；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"더럽다","audio":"/audio/af422da88e6c5a06f998.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47384","senseId":"1","lemma":"더럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더러워지지","audio":"/audio/63cce559834f3b7df30d.mp3"}},{"text":"않을까?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않을까","audio":"/audio/8063f96e81572fc69fb4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"af422da88e6c5a06","term":"더럽다","zh":"脏，污浊","audio":"/audio/af422da88e6c5a06f998.mp3","entryId":"47384","definition":"沾有污渍或渣滓而脏污不干净。","pronunciation":["더ː럽따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/b7de9f0a9876acb32e97.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.41,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62883","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":47,"sequenceScore":2.0634,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["都在下雨了，不会弄脏吗？","我可以穿白色衣服出门吗？","裕敏，你最擅长的运动是什么？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我可以穿白色衣服出门吗？","裕敏，你最擅长的运动是什么？","都在下雨了，不会弄脏吗？"],"answer":2}]}
